        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ColdSide: Retro Edition</strong> is a reimagined version of the 2020 indie horror game, recreated in the style of classic retro titles.<br>You once again find yourself in an abandoned bunker where research on anomalous phenomena is underway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s new in Retro Edition</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully updated visual style: “dirty” textures, vintage noise, and retro color grading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved effects and lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor gameplay and visual polish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original story remains unchanged.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a researcher who heads to a sealed facility to uncover what happened to a group of scientists and what forces lie beneath the ground</p>",
